GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
# One properties file per brand, <slug>-key.properties. The trailing * catches
# the .pending suffix a brand's credentials sit behind until its key goes live.
# key.properties was Sabily's name until 2026-10-04; still ignored so a stale
# copy on another machine never gets committed.
key.properties*
*-key.properties*
# A keystore password written down next to the keystore. It was committed once
# (removed 2026-10-04); a password belongs in <slug>-key.properties only.
/app/password.txt
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# An upload certificate is public, but it is an artefact of a key ceremony and
# belongs with the keystore, not in the history.
**/*-upload-cert.pem
